            "review_title": "Review at ThaiExpress",
            "review_text": "AnniceRose\nStockton-on-Tees, United Kingdom39 contributions\n0\nNot Great\nAug 2017 • Couples\nChose to eat here as it looked nice from the menus outside. \nWe were sat down by a window which was nice. Except it was right opposite the food disposal station and there were waiters walking past constantly. \nWe ordered food and drink. My partners food came 10 mins after ordering. I told him to start eating as mine appeared to be taking a little longer. 35 mins and 2 drinks later my food arrived. \nObviously we were not happy about this but because of the language barrier we did not want to complain. \nWe were told that it was a difficult dish to make and that was why it took so long...a second waiter told us the chef had burnt the first one. \nI would have been happy if I had been informed much earlier...but there was no apologies or reason for it being late given until it arrived. \n\nThe food was average. \nWouldn't recommend it for anyone really. The atmosphere was pretty average...more like that of a school dining hall.\nRead more\nWritten August 18, 2017",
